# cruxx environment variables
## Copy to .env and fill in values, or use dotenvx for encrypted secrets.
#
## Usage with dotenvx:
##   dotenvx set OPENAI_API_KEY "sk-..."
##   dotenvx run -- cruxx run examples/extract_entities.yaml examples/input_entities.json
##
## Usage with 1Password + dotenvx (add to a gitignored CLAUDE.local.md):
##   DOTENV_PRIVATE_KEY=$(op read "op://...") dotenvx run -- cruxx plan --goal "..."

### Crux Environment
#
##
#

### LLM providers (at least one required for llm::invoke, llm::extract, plan)
#
## OpenAI — default model: gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_API_KEY=""
# OPENAI_MODEL="gpt-4o-mini"
#
## Anthropic — default model: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL="claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
#
## Ollama (local models, no API key required)
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434"

### Debugging
#
# RUST_LOG="cruxx=debug"
